{"id":"huseby-bruk","start":"https://husebybruk.com/","read":"2026-11-03","pages":[{"url":"https://husebybruk.com/","status":200,"title":"Huseby Bruk","text":"Huseby Bruk \n V lkommen till fantastiska \n . \n Brukshandeln \n Smedjan \n Kvarnen \n Rundtur p bruket \n Husebymaden \n Julmarknaden \n Konferens \n Biltr ff \n Karta ver Huseby \n Kontaktinfo \n Sev rt i Kronoberg"},{"url":"https://husebybruk.com/gb/index.htm","status":200,"title":"Huseby Bruk, handcraft and culture since 600 year, a royal bit of Sweden","text":"Huseby Bruk, handcraft and culture since 600 year, a royal bit of Sweden \n Welcome to Huseby Bruk \n You are most welcome at Huseby Bruk, 20 km south west of V�xj� in Sweden.\nThe works estate offers a numbers of attraktions, including \nironworks-museum, a mill, a display of wagons, an Archimedes� screw, a cotter-museum etc. There are guided walks around the outdoor area. A varity of\nbusinesses have been established along the road to the works.\nThe area also includes a restaurant, caf� and a display of the natural features of the district. \nGuided tours are also held in the manor house on the estate. These may be booked in advance for groups of visitors all year rond. Guides are also \navailable for individuals during the summer and during special events. New attractions are added from time to time."},{"url":"https://husebybruk.com/brukshandeln/index.htm","status":200,"title":"Huseby Brukshandel","text":"Huseby Brukshandel \n Brukshandeln \n Brukshandeln drevs under m�nga �r av Ulf Hedlund. Han har nu slutat som \n handlare men kommer d� och d� att mala mj�l p� den gamla vatten-hjuls drivan \n kvarnen som finns j�mte aff�ren."},{"url":"https://husebybruk.com/smedjan/index.htm","status":200,"title":"Smedjan p� Huseby Bruk","text":"Smedjan p� Huseby Bruk \nUlf och Carina Magnusson\nTel:0470-75 50 91 \n Vi tillverkar och s�ljer �ven handst�pta milj�v�nliga Boltonljus av h�g kvalitet. \n Vill du veta mer om vad Sm�kullen kan erbjuda eller se v�rat